{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 2.380000114440918, "text": "You don't actually need aerodynamics.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 2.380000114440918, "end_seconds": 7.800000190734863, "text": "Here, I have a little cart with a big wheel that rolls on two smaller spools.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 7.800000190734863, "end_seconds": 13.84000015258789, "text": "And what I'm going to show is that when you have two media moving relative to one another,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 13.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 17.239999771118164, "text": "well then, if this car is in contact with both media,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
