{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 22.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 26.479999542236328, "text": "So as I push the board to the right,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 26.479999542236328, "end_seconds": 33.279998779296875, "text": "you can see that the car goes down the board faster than the board is moving.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 33.279998779296875, "end_seconds": 40.31999969482422, "text": "If you look carefully, you'll see that the big wheel isn't turning the way that the board is pushing it.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 40.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 43.36000061035156, "text": "It's actually rotating in the opposite direction.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 43.36000061035156, "end_seconds": 49.08000183105469, "text": "That's just like the propeller on Blackbird, which pushes back against the air,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "2GUah9xHVto", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 49.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 53.68000030517578, "text": "and that's how it's able to go faster than the wind downwind.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
